{"date":"2015-12-28","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f8/25/160970_65nfZ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f8/25/160970_65nfZ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f8/25/160970_65nfZ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f8/25/160970_65nfZ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f8/25/160970_65nfZ.jpg"},"summary":"猫土，本是一片猫的乐园 ，自从邪恶的势力统治了猫土后，混沌遮天蔽日，魔物肆虐横行。只有会神奇功夫的“京剧猫”才能带领众生打倒邪恶的首领解救猫土！\r\n\r\n咚锵镇的少年白糖，年幼时曾被京剧猫所救，他发下誓言，长大后要成为一名伟大的京剧猫。在一次与魔物的战斗中，他结识了武崧、小青和大飞 ，并一起拜京剧猫的末裔——金花婆婆和唐明为师，和伙伴们一起学功夫。少年白糖既没有名门血统，也没有过人的天分，但他依靠惊人的努力和一颗永不言弃的心，突破了重重考验，他要和勇敢的伙伴们一起，打倒邪恶势力，拯救家园！","name":"京剧猫","name_cn":"京剧猫","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":122,"total_cont":0},{"name":"热血","count":73,"total_cont":0},{"name":"TV","count":49,"total_cont":0},{"name":"童年","count":41,"total_cont":0},{"name":"子供向","count":39,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2015","count":39,"total_cont":0},{"name":"友情","count":35,"total_cont":0},{"name":"京剧猫","count":31,"total_cont":0},{"name":"治愈","count":31,"total_cont":0},{"name":"璀璨星空","count":24,"total_cont":0},{"name":"国漫","count":23,"total_cont":0},{"name":"战斗","count":21,"total_cont":0},{"name":"中国","count":14,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":11,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画","count":4,"total_cont":0},{"name":"冒险","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"奇幻","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"搞笑","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"无","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"TVA","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"中国动画","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2010-2019","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动漫","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"傅博","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"李冠宣","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"标记","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动作","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"赞","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"坑","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"彭擎政","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"京剧猫"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"Beijing Opera Cats"}]},{"key":"话数",